
---

**Install** — the zip is ad-hoc signed, not notarized, so the first launch needs a
right-click → **Open** (or the `xattr` line below). Details in the
[README](https://github.com/tangentyh/displaykeep#install).

```sh
unzip -o @PKGNAME@.zip -d ~/Applications
xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Applications/DisplayKeep.app
open ~/Applications/DisplayKeep.app
```

Then click the menu bar icon → **Start at login** if you want it to run from now on.
Needs macOS 13+; Apple silicon unless built on an Intel runner.

```
@SHA@  @PKGNAME@.zip
```
